{"seq":1,"slug":"virtual-grids-tables","title":"虚拟网格与表格","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-virtualization-windowing/advanced/virtual-grids-tables","wordCount":1347,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"虚拟网格与表格\">虚拟网格与表格</h1><p>到目前为止，窗口化都是一维的：沿垂直方向切窗口。但电子表格、数据网格、图片瀑布流是二维的——十万行乘上百列，全量渲染就是千万级单元格，比长列表更容易压垮浏览器。这一篇把 <a href=\"../foundations/windowing-model\">窗口化模型</a> 的一维抽象推广到二维：行和列同时虚拟化，并叠加表格特有的固定表头、固定列、单元格跨度等复杂度。它是「数据网格也要丝滑」这一诉求的技术内核。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-二维窗口-行与列的笛卡尔积\">核心概念：二维窗口，行与列的笛卡尔积</h2><p>二维虚拟化的核心是把一维的「可见区计算」沿两个轴各做一遍，再取笛卡尔积。垂直方向算出可见行区间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[r_s, r_e]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，水平方向算出可见列区间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[c_s, c_e]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，真正渲染的单元格集合就是这两个区间的乘积：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>cells</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cells} = \\{ (r, c) \\mid r_s \\le r \\le r_e,\\ c_s \\le c \\le c_e \\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cells</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>渲染的单元格数从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>row</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>col</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_\\text{row} \\times n_\\text{col}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">row</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">col</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(r_e - r_s) \\times (c_e - c_s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>——一个常数乘常数。每个轴各自维护自己的尺寸模型：行用行高前缀和，列用列宽前缀和，定高定宽时退化为乘法，变高变宽时各自二分（机制同 <a href=\"../mechanics/fixed-vs-variable-height\">定高与变高</a>，只是做两遍）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[滚动位置 scrollTop scrollLeft] --&gt; B[&quot;垂直轴:算可见行区间 r_s..r_e&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; C[&quot;水平轴:算可见列区间 c_s..c_e&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; D[&quot;行前缀和:行偏移与总高&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; E[&quot;列前缀和:列偏移与总宽&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; F[渲染单元格 = 行区间 × 列区间 的笛卡尔积]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[&quot;用 translate(x, y) 摆放每个单元格&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[滚动位置 scrollTop scrollLeft] --&gt; B[\"垂直轴:算可见行区间 r_s..r_e\"]\n  A --&gt; C[\"水平轴:算可见列区间 c_s..c_e\"]\n  B --&gt; D[\"行前缀和:行偏移与总高\"]\n  C --&gt; E[\"列前缀和:列偏移与总宽\"]\n  D --&gt; F[渲染单元格 = 行区间 × 列区间 的笛卡尔积]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[\"用 translate(x, y) 摆放每个单元格\"]</pre><h2 id=\"固定表头与固定列\">固定表头与固定列</h2><p>数据表格不能纯靠二维窗口，因为表头和首列必须始终可见——滚到第十万行还得知道每列是什么。固定区域把网格切成几块，各有不同的虚拟化策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>区域</th>\n<th>水平虚拟化</th>\n<th>垂直虚拟化</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>表头（顶部）</td>\n<td>是，随主体横滚</td>\n<td>否，钉在顶部</td>\n<td>列虚拟化，但不随竖滚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固定列（左侧）</td>\n<td>否，钉在左侧</td>\n<td>是，随主体竖滚</td>\n<td>行虚拟化，但不随横滚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>左上角交叉块</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>始终固定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主体</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>完整二维虚拟化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实现上有两条路线：一是 <code>position: sticky</code>，让表头/固定列在滚动时自动黏住，结构简单但 sticky 与 transform 摆放、与虚拟化的窗口切换有时会打架；二是把固定区域拆成独立的滚动同步面板——表头是单独的虚拟化容器，监听主体的 <code>scrollLeft</code> 做横向同步。后者控制力强但要手动保持多个面板的滚动一致，错一点就会出现表头与列内容错位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"单元格跨度与不规则结构\">单元格跨度与不规则结构</h2><p>真实表格里还有合并单元格（<code>colspan</code>/<code>rowspan</code>）、分组行、可展开的子行。这些打破了「单元格是规则网格」的假设，给二维虚拟化带来麻烦：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>跨度单元格</strong>：一个跨 3 列的单元格，其窗口归属要按它覆盖的所有列判断——只要它覆盖的任一列在可见区，就得渲染它，且渲染时要正确处理它溢出可见列区间的部分。</li>\n<li><strong>分组/展开行</strong>：展开一个分组会动态插入子行，行高前缀和要随之更新，这本质是变高列表的动态高度问题，复用机制章的测量与锚定（见 <a href=\"../mechanics/measurement-caching\">测量与缓存</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>粘性分组头</strong>：分组标题在滚动时黏在顶部直到下一组到来，是 sticky 与虚拟化叠加的典型难点。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>经验是：跨度与分组越多，纯手写二维虚拟化越容易出错，越应该用成熟库（数据网格类如 TanStack Table + TanStack Virtual 组合，或 AG Grid 这类内置虚拟化的网格），库对比见 <a href=\"../practice/virtualization-libraries\">虚拟化库选型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"性能-二维比一维更吃重渲染\">性能：二维比一维更吃重渲染</h2><p>二维虚拟化渲染的单元格数是两个区间的乘积，即便各自只有十几，乘起来也有几百个。这意味着：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>滚动重算更频繁更重</strong>：横滚和竖滚都触发重算，且单元格 diff 量是行 diff 的数倍。单元格组件必须严格 memo 化，避免父级重渲染时整片单元格重算——这是网格卡顿的头号原因，参考 <a href=\"../../performance-optimization/rendering-performance/react-rendering-optimization\">React 渲染优化</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>合成层管理</strong>：大量 transform 摆放的单元格若各自提升为合成层，会爆显存。要控制合成层数量，原理见 <a href=\"../../browser-rendering-internals/pipeline/compositing\">合成</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>横向过扫描独立调</strong>：横滚和竖滚的过扫描应分开设置——宽表格横滚频繁，水平过扫描可略大；行高重时垂直过扫描要收紧（过扫描原理见 <a href=\"../foundations/viewport-overscan\">可见区与过扫描</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>二维虚拟化 = 沿垂直、水平两轴各做一遍可见区计算，渲染单元格是两个区间的笛卡尔积，单元格数从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>row</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>col</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_\\text{row} \\times n_\\text{col}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">row</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">col</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 降到常数乘常数。</li>\n<li>表格把网格切成表头/固定列/交叉块/主体四区，各有不同的虚拟化轴；实现走 <code>position: sticky</code> 或独立滚动同步面板，后者强但要手动保持滚动一致。</li>\n<li>合并单元格、分组展开、粘性分组头打破规则网格假设，复用变高机制处理动态高度；复杂度高时优先用成熟数据网格库。</li>\n<li>二维渲染更吃重渲染，单元格必须严格 memo 化、控制合成层数量、横竖过扫描分别调优。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>两轴尺寸模型的来源：<a href=\"../mechanics/fixed-vs-variable-height\">定高与变高</a>、<a href=\"../foundations/viewport-overscan\">可见区与过扫描</a></li>\n<li>分组展开的动态高度：<a href=\"../mechanics/measurement-caching\">测量与缓存</a></li>\n<li>网格选哪个库：<a href=\"../practice/virtualization-libraries\">虚拟化库选型</a></li>\n<li>跨库——单元格重渲染优化：<a href=\"../../performance-optimization/rendering-performance/react-rendering-optimization\">React 渲染优化</a></li>\n<li>跨库——合成层管理：<a href=\"../../browser-rendering-internals/pipeline/compositing\">合成</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"虚拟网格与表格","id":"虚拟网格与表格"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：二维窗口，行与列的笛卡尔积","id":"核心概念-二维窗口-行与列的笛卡尔积"},{"level":2,"text":"固定表头与固定列","id":"固定表头与固定列"},{"level":2,"text":"单元格跨度与不规则结构","id":"单元格跨度与不规则结构"},{"level":2,"text":"性能：二维比一维更吃重渲染","id":"性能-二维比一维更吃重渲染"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"滚动锚定与跳动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-virtualization-windowing/mechanics/scroll-anchoring"},"next":{"title":"无限滚动与分页","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-virtualization-windowing/advanced/infinite-scroll-paging"}}